  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "1 · compose.yaml (repo root)",
      "items": [
        "edge, web, app, worker (1), db; .env optional, DAWAM_ENCRYPTION_KEY required.",
        "Ollama only with --profile ollama; no mail server, no demo source.",
        "HSTS default 31536000; DAWAM_TRUSTED_PROXY_CIDRS lets a TLS proxy in front set the scheme."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "2 · deploy/docker-compose.yaml (all-in-one)",
      "items": [
        ".env required; DAWAM_STORAGE_BACKEND=local fixed; HTTPS disabled (HSTS 0, no trusted TLS proxy).",
        "worker replicas DAWAM_WORKERS (default 2), safe because claims use SKIP LOCKED.",
        "ollama + ollama-pull always on (OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH 32768; qwen2.5:7b, nomic-embed-text).",
        "mailpit on 127.0.0.1:8025; source-db only with --profile demo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "3 · deploy/host (no Docker, systemd)",
      "items": [
        "dawam-app, dawam-web, dawam-worker units as user dawam on 127.0.0.1; hardened (ProtectSystem=strict, NoNewPrivileges).",
        "Host nginx.conf on 127.0.0.1:8080 with edge's routing; DAWAM_FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS=127.0.0.1.",
        "Secrets in /etc/dawam/dawam.env (app and worker only); Postgres 16 + pgvector from packages."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "GPU override (with variant 1 or 2)",
      "items": [
        "Builds app and worker with ACCELERATOR=cuda (CUDA torch, onnxruntime-gpu) and gives the worker all NVIDIA GPUs.",
        "Only document AI (Docling layout/tables, RapidOCR) uses it; the host variant picks ocr-gpu at pip install instead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Dashed = configuration-dependent",
      "items": [
        "Ollama is used only after an admin adds it as an OpenAI-compatible provider (http://ollama:11434/v1).",
        "Mailpit receives mail only once Admin > Email points at host mailpit:1025; the app sends, the worker was not seen sending.",
        "Demo source DB is reached only after a Connection is added; tests run in app, extraction in worker.",
        "S3 storage is set by DAWAM_STORAGE_BACKEND=s3; no shipped Compose file uses it. deploy/README methods 3-4 (local dev, local run) were not diagrammed."
      ]
    }
  ]
